.TH "PKGSOURCE_PROFILES_YAML" "5" "" "libpkgsource\-yaml 1.0.1" "libpkgsource\-yaml"
.SH NAME
pkgsource_profiles_yaml \- describe the native profiles YAML version 1 protocol
.SH DESCRIPTION
A \f[CR]zeppe\-lin.profiles/1\f[R] document contains exactly the required \f[CR]format\f[R] and \f[CR]profiles\f[R] keys.
\f[CR]profiles\f[R] is a mapping and may be empty.
.PP
Each profile key omits the leading \f[CR]\[at]\f[R].
Its value contains exactly one required, non\-empty \f[CR]members\f[R] sequence.
Every member is an explicit one\-key mapping:
.IP
.EX
\- package: gcc
\- profile: \[dq]\[at]compiler\[dq]
.EE
.PP
Scalar shorthand is invalid.
Package and profile subjects are distinct value domains.
.SH PARSING AND SEALING
The parser returns \f[CR]profile_declaration\f[R] values with document, protocol\-path, line, and column provenance.
It does not require every nested profile to occur in the same document because a caller may aggregate declarations from multiple explicit documents.
.PP
Only \f[CR]profile_catalog::seal()\f[R] owns duplicate\-definition and duplicate\-member rejection, unknown\-profile and cycle detection, deterministic expansion, normalization, and profile identities.
.SH YAML CONTRACT
Exactly one strict YAML document is accepted.
Directives, anchors, aliases, merge keys, custom or incompatible tags, duplicate keys, complex mapping keys, unknown schema keys, and type drift are rejected.
Parser resource limits apply.
.SH SEE ALSO
\f[CR]pkgsource_yaml(3)\f[R], \f[CR]pkgsource_recipe_yaml(5)\f[R]
